message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "LEAP: Leukemia End-to-End Analysis Platform"
abstract: >-
  Weakly supervised recognition of acute promyelocytic leukemia and other acute myeloid
  leukemia features from bone marrow aspirate smear whole-slide images, using attention-based
  multiple-instance learning over single-cell patches.
